t":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":8,"official_events":4,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"d33e6f761dc6b78c8174460d27859fb8d22747dd048d17be9ffdd4bd839d5d76","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","positioning_accuracy"],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 蝉圈圈\n蝉圈圈是**蝉妈妈（蝉大师）旗下面向品牌商家的达人营销SaaS管理平台**，主打**达人种草、带货合作全流程管理**，对接抖音、小红书、快手、视频号多平台达人资源。\n\n\n## ✅ 核心作用（商家视角）\n1. **筛选达人**：AI匹配达人，可按粉丝、品类、带货数据筛选海量KOL/KOC，直接在平台发起招募任务\n2. **全流程管理**：达人建联、样品寄送、合作订单、内容排期统一管理，跟踪样品寄送进度、合作状态\n3. **数据监测**：依托蝉妈妈大数据，自动监测达人发布内容的曝光、互动、成交ROI，自动生成营销报表\n4. **团队绩效**：自动核算商务提成，管理团队业绩、沉淀达人资源库（达人CRM）\n5. **撮合商单**：可以发布任务让达人自主接单，也可购买一站式达人种草投放服务\n\n## 🧾 一句话总结\n商家用来**批量找达人、管达人种草带货合作、看投放数据**的工具，把达人商务、寄样、复盘整套流程线上化。\n\n> 注意：蝉圈圈主要是**给品牌/商家用**的，普通达人一般用蝉选（蝉妈妈旗下达人选品平台）接商家带货单。\n\n如果你想，我可以简单对比下**蝉圈圈 vs 蝉选 vs 蝉妈妈**三者区别。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0113","question_id":"CQ-Q0113","citation_id":"smp-335f8d0a2f094694ba18adab0048da73:1","title":"蝉圈圈 - 一站式多平台达人营销及种草解决方案","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/bridge","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/bridge","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0113","question_id":"CQ-Q0113","citation_id":"smp-335f8d0a2f094694ba18adab0048da73:2","title":"关于我们 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/about.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/about.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0113","question_id":"CQ-Q0113","citation_id":"smp-335f8d0a2f094694ba18adab0048da73:3","title":"抖店服务市场-服务详情","raw_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/detail?service_id=32167","normalized_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/detail?service_id=32167","host":"fuwu.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_sup